## Typography

| Role | Size | Weight | Color |
|------|------|--------|-------|
| Page title (h1) | 1.75rem | 700 | `--text-heading` |
| Section title (h2) | 1.125rem | 700 | `--text-heading` |
| Card title (h3/h4) | 0.875–1rem | 600–700 | `--text-heading` |
| Body | 0.875rem (14px) | 400 | `--text-body` |
| Label / caption | 0.75rem (12px) | 500–600 | `--text-muted` |
| Timestamp / meta | 0.625rem (10px) | 600 | `--text-muted` |
| Badge | 0.625rem | 700 | contextual |

Letter-spacing: labels uppercase `tracking-wider` (0.05em) for section headers like "Last chats", "Files".

