## Icon navigation strip (maps to `nav-bar` refactor)

Width **70px**, `--panel-bg`, border-right `--border-light`.

| Element | Style |
|---------|-------|
| Logo | 32px twin-shape: brand green + orange-400 pill shapes, rotated accent bg |
| Nav button | 40×40px, radius `--radius-md`, slate-400 icon |
| Nav hover | brand color + `--main-bg` bg |
| Nav active | `brand/10` bg, brand icon, 3px brand left bar, `--shadow-premium` |
| Profile avatar | 40px circle, ring `brand-light/50`, online dot bottom-right |

Icons mapping (mat-icon equivalents):
- Dashboard → `schedule`
- Tasks → `check_box_outline_blank`
- Views → `visibility`
- Chats (active) → `groups`
- Analytics → `bar_chart`
- Video → `videocam`

Logged-in links (Groups, Invitations, Profile) → integrate into icon strip or secondary sidebar.

