## Buttons

### Primary (CTA)
```scss
background: var(--brand);
color: #fff;
border-radius: var(--radius-md);
padding: 12px 16px;
font-weight: 600;
box-shadow: var(--shadow-premium);
&:hover { background: var(--brand-dark); }
&:active { transform: scale(0.97); }
&:disabled { background: var(--border-default); color: var(--text-muted); }
```

### Primary circle (send, FAB)
36–40px circle, brand bg, white icon, hover scale 1.05, active scale 0.95.

### Secondary / ghost
Transparent, slate-400 icon, hover `--main-bg` circle (32px).

### Pill tab switcher
Container: `--main-bg`, padding 6px, radius full, inner shadow.
Active tab: `--brand` bg, white text, shadow. Inactive: slate-500, hover slate-800.

### Danger
Text/icon `#ef4444`, hover `#fef2f2` bg. Used in group-card delete.

### Icon button (32×32)
Circle, hover `--main-bg` or slate-200. Used for attach, emoji, search, settings.

