## Inputs & forms

### Text input / textarea (auth, search, message)
- Background: `--main-bg` (search/auth) or transparent (inside pill composer)
- Border: none (search/composer) or `1px solid --border-default` (auth fields)
- Border-radius: full pill (search/composer) or `--radius-md` (auth)
- Padding: 12px 16px (auth), 12px 20px (search with icon left)
- Focus: ring 1px `--brand`, outline none
- Placeholder: `--text-muted`

### Auth card (`_auth-shared.scss`, login, register)
- Centered on `--app-bg`, max-width 24rem
- Card: white bg, `--shadow-card`, radius `--radius-2xl`, border `--border-light`
- Fields: light inputs on white (not dark `#0f172a`)
- Primary button: brand green (not blue `#3b82f6`)
- Links: brand color
- Divider: `--border-default` lines
- Errors: `--error` on `--error-bg` subtle bg

### Google sign-in button
White bg, border `--border-default`, radius `--radius-md`, Google colors preserved in logo only.

