## Cards & lists

### Generic card
White bg, radius `--radius-lg`, border `--border-light`, `--shadow-sm`, padding `--space-6`.

### Group card (`group-card`)
- White card, hover `--shadow-premium`, radius `--radius-lg`
- Title: semibold `--text-heading`
- Members count: `--text-muted`, 0.85rem
- Danger action: `--error`

### Group list / invitations / profile
- Page bg: `--main-bg` inside main panel
- List items: padding 14px, radius `--radius-lg`
- Active item: `#f8fafc` bg + 3px left `--brand` border
- Empty state: centered, muted text, optional brand accent icon

### Search bar (global pattern)
Full-width pill, `--main-bg`, magnifying glass icon left (16px padding-left for icon), no visible border.

