## Chat module (full spec)

### Layout zones
| Zone | Width | Background |
|------|-------|------------|
| Chat list sidebar | 340px | white |
| Main chat | flex-1 | `--main-bg` |
| Files strip | 85px | white |

### Chat room header
Frosted white, title bold, status with green ping dot + muted text.
Tabs: Messages / Participants pill switcher.
Actions: search icon, chevron to toggle files panel.

### Message bubbles (`message-item`)
**Own (`--own`):** right-aligned, max 80%, timestamp "You, HH:mm" above, bubble `--bubble-self`, radius 20px with top-right 4px corner, border `rgba(148,163,184,0.5)`.

**Others:** avatar 36px left, timestamp above, white bubble, top-left 4px corner, border `--border-light`.

Spacing between message groups: 24px. No full-width card bg on `.message-item`.

### Message form
Frosted footer, pill composer on `--main-bg` with inner shadow, transparent textarea, brand circle send button. Keep attach + AI + emoji-picker.

### Message list
Scrollable, custom thin scrollbar, empty state friendly copy.

### Typing indicator
Avatar + white pill, author name semibold, 3 brand dots bounce (stagger 0.1s).

### Participants tab
White card radius `--radius-xl`, member rows hover slate-50, role in muted 10px.

