## Do / Don't

**Do:**
- Use BEM naming consistently across all features
- Centralize tokens in `styles.scss` — reference `var(--brand)` in components
- Use frosted headers/footers (`--frosted-bg` + backdrop-filter) for sticky bars
- Keep mat-icon for all icons
- Preserve emoji font stacks in message textareas
- Test Hebrew/RTL in agent-chat and user-generated content

**Don't:**
- Add Tailwind CDN or utility classes
- Use Font Awesome
- Hardcode dark theme colors (`#0f172a`, `#111827`) in new code
- Use blue `#3b82f6` as primary — brand green replaces it
- Break accessibility: always `aria-label`, `:focus-visible` rings in brand color
- Introduce one-off hex values when a token exists
